		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Aquatic faerie women with long, slippery black hair. Haunt rivers and waterways near towns and cities. Drowns passersby if not placated with offerings.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 47, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 hair (near) +7 (2d6) or song, <strong>MV</strong> near (swim), <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 10</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Invisible</strong>. Turn invisible in water. Can sing without becoming visible.</p><p></p><p><strong>Song</strong>. All targets who can hear within double near, CHA 15+ or beguiled and drawn to rusalka for 1d4 rounds. On success, immune for 1 day.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
